  referencias:"Kramer RE et al. Management of ingested foreign bodies in children: a clinical report of the NASPGHAN Endoscopy Committee. J Pediatr Gastroenterol Nutr, 2015; Sociedade Brasileira de Pediatria. Corpo estranho — Documento Científico, 2020.",
